{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14204","headline":"开元观陪杜大夫中元日观乐 · 戎昱","name":"开元观陪杜大夫中元日观乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝欢称玉京天，况值关东俗理年。\n舞态疑回紫阳女，歌声似遏彩云仙。\n盘空双鹤惊几剑，洒砌三花度管弦。\n落日香尘拥归骑，囗风油幕动高烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}